      "question": "黑色车壳与金属机械部件的分层区域及表面外观是否符合参考？",
      "weight": 0.0625
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "source_quote": "Use real editable three-dimensional geometry.",
      "question": "原生几何是否为可编辑的完整立体结构，而非图像平面或朝向相机的薄壳替代物？",
      "weight": 0.0625
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "source_quote": "Distinct components should be editable objects or clearly separable mesh islands; organic surfaces may remain continuous.",
